-
-.. math::
-   
-  \phi_{BM}(r,\{\alpha, \beta, w\}) = 
-  \begin{cases}
-  \frac{1}{S}\exp\left[\beta(\sqrt{1-(r/(h\alpha))^2}-1)\right] & |r|/(hw/2)\le 1\\
